<title>CANADA: Bre-X alliance seen bringing permits closer.</title>
<headline>Bre-X alliance seen bringing permits closer.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>A new alliance between Bre-X Minerals Ltd and Indonesia's private PT Panutan Duta announced on Monday brings Bre-X closer to obtaining its elusive contracts of work, analysts said.</p>
<p>&quot;They seemed to have teamed up with a partner with high standing,&quot; said mining analyst Michael Fowler of brokerage Levesque Beaubien Geoffrion.</p>
<p>&quot;It helps to get the contract of work.&quot;</p>
<p>The news pushed the stock up 3.30 to 24.15 in heavy trading of 1.5 million shares in the few minutes after trading resumed on the Toronto Stock Exchange.</p>
